**Title Page Style (Example - to be set in Word)**
*   Book Title: Segoe UI Light, 36pt, Centered
*   Subtitle: Segoe UI Light, 24pt, Centered
*   Author: Calibri, 12pt, Centered

**Heading 1 Style (Example - to be set in Word)**
*   Font: Segoe UI Light, 20pt, Bold
*   Spacing: Before: 24pt, After: 12pt
*   Keep with next: Enabled

**Heading 2 Style (Example - to be set in Word)**
*   Font: Segoe UI Light, 16pt, Bold
*   Spacing: Before: 18pt, After: 6pt
*   Keep with next: Enabled

**Heading 3 Style (Example - to be set in Word)**
*   Font: Segoe UI Light, 14pt, Bold
*   Spacing: Before: 12pt, After: 4pt
*   Keep with next: Enabled

**Normal (Body Text) Style (Example - to be set in Word)**
*   Font: Calibri, 11pt
*   Line Spacing: 1.15 lines
*   Widow/Orphan control: Enabled

**Code Block Style (Example - to be set in Word - often a custom style like "Code")**
*   Font: Consolas, 10pt
*   Shading: Light Grey background
*   Keep lines together: Enabled

**Caption Style (Example - to be set in Word)**
*   Font: Calibri, 9pt, Italic
*   Spacing: After: 6pt

**List Paragraph Style (Example - to be set in Word - applied to bulleted/numbered lists)**
*   Font: Calibri, 11pt
*   Appropriate indentation for list levels.

**Page Layout (Example - to be set in Word)**
*   Margins: 1 inch (Top, Bottom, Left, Right)
*   Header: Book Title (left aligned), Page Number (right aligned) - Font: Calibri, 9pt
*   Footer: Chapter Title (centered) - Font: Calibri, 9pt

**Widow/Orphan Control must be enabled for the 'Normal' style and other paragraph styles.**
**'Keep with next' must be enabled for all Heading styles.**
**'Keep lines together' can be useful for short paragraphs or code blocks if desired.**

